    {
      "id": "00ed7dc2-eecf-53de-8d31-27174888db78",
      "document_id": "tech/lfi-api-hub/v2.2-rc2/consent-management-interface/insurance-data-sharing/requirements",
      "type": "section",
      "text": "CMI — Insurance Data Sharing Requirements > Dashboard — card content\n\nEach Insurance Data Sharing consent card on the dashboard must show the following fields.\n\nField | Content\nTPP name | Name of the TPP the consent was granted to\nStatus badge | Mapped label from Status labels\nPolicy count | Number of connected policies, e.g. 1 Policy Connected\n or 2 Policies Connected\nConsent Type | Data Sharing\nLast data received | Date the most recent data was retrieved under this consent\nConnection expires | Date the consent expires",
