    {
      "id": "d6a6189c-6696-57d3-aef3-00835951f523",
      "document_id": "tech/lfi-api-hub/v2.2-rc2/consent-management-interface/insurance-data-sharing/requirements",
      "type": "section",
      "text": "CMI — Insurance Data Sharing Requirements > Detail page\n\nSelecting a consent on the dashboard opens its detail page. The detail page presents the same information the customer saw at the time they gave consent — the permissions, policies, and conditions that defined what they agreed to. In addition to all fields shown on the dashboard card, the detail page must show a truncated Consent ID with a copy button (format: f47ac10b...d479\n).",
