    {
      "id": "295c441a-7850-5207-86a9-d9ecbf299478",
      "document_id": "tech/lfi-api-hub/v2.2-rc2/consent-management-interface/insurance-data-sharing/requirements",
      "type": "section",
      "text": "CMI — Insurance Data Sharing Requirements > Detail page — action buttons\n\nThe LFI CMI does not include Pause or Reactivate buttons. These are TPP-only concepts.\n\nButton | Label | Shown when\nRevoke | Stop Sharing | Status is AwaitingAuthorization\n, Authorized\n, or Suspended\n\nNo action buttons are shown when status is Expired\n, Rejected\n, or Revoked\n.",
